      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article reviews the concept of airway remodeling, through various inflammatory cells, the roles of angiogenesis, vascular endothelial cell growth factor, respiratory syncytial virus, and other biomarkers, including exhaled nitric oxide. Control of allergic asthma using immunomodulation and other strategies is addressed."},
